1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,708
At dusk, the last mail train leaves the valley with one letter still to deliver.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,208
Inside the sorting car, the clerk stamps the envelope and sends it on its way.

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,292
At the last house, a light comes on. The letter has reached Bellwater.
